<title>USA: Santa Fe Cty, N.M., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Cty, N.M., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc. said it won $10.500 million of Santa Fe Cty, N.M., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.344 percent.</p>
